<div class="project__info">
  <div class="project__info-L">
    <p class="big">
      Deadrop is a game built by veterans of Call of Duty, Halo and Fortnite, developed with a fan-first approach. Its launch event was a live experience for fans.
    </p>
    <p>
      Deadrop was one of the most ambitious early-access FPS titles. Midnight Society, a studio founded by former developers from some of gaming's biggest franchises, built it. Its "Snapshot" events let fans see new game builds, feature reveals and hands-on demos.
    </p>
    <p>
      For this event, I worked with Midnight Society's developers to produce feature videos, motion graphics and an event design package for a live show at Esports Stadium Arlington.
    </p>
