<h2 class="project__step-title">Developer Features</h2>
<div class="side-by-side">
  <div>
    <p>
      Midnight Society is a remote studio, and its developers are rarely in the same room. For the Snapshot event, I was on location with them during a rare meetup. I sat down with them on camera, had them explain the game's features and edited the interviews into feature videos for the event. Day 1 was sit-down interviews and editing the raw footage. On Day 2, I designed motion graphics and worked with the developers to capture in-game footage.
    </p>
    <p>
      In a few days I delivered a full video package, motion design, social assets to promote the live broadcast and graphics for the arena. The event had presenting sponsor Cheez-It, and thousands of fans filled the arena to see new features, watch influencers compete on stage and play the game at demo stations.
    </p>
  </div>

