<h2 class="project__step-title">Broadcast and Arena Design</h2>
<div class="side-by-side">
  <p>
    At the arena, I built a motion design system for the event's video features, broadcast loops, stingers and arena billboards. With access to developer builds, I captured in-game environments and composited loops. Designer Mateo Julia-Wise and I rendered extra-wide motion graphics for the arena's triple screens and the digital billboards throughout the stadium.
  </p>
  <p>
    With the event video and design delivered to the control room, I attended the event as a videographer and captured interviews and footage that the dev team used to promote the game afterward.
  </p>
</div>
